{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394030/extras/c1a2d017ab2463090370ed2600eb6824.poster.avif?t=1772040068\" width=1024 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394030/extras/c1a2d017ab2463090370ed2600eb6824.webm?t=1772040068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394030/extras/c1a2d017ab2463090370ed2600eb6824.mp4?t=1772040068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daniel and Jessica Stewart have decided to remodel their first home. Old and dilapidated, they begin to record the adventures of their renovation, but the couple soon discovers their new home hides much more than asbestos and faulty wiring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they dig deeper into the mysterious house, their excitement turns to concern when they uncover strange markings and items hidden within the walls. The more time they spend there, the clearer it becomes that they are not the home\u2019s only occupant. Sinking deeper into the influences of a dark presence, Daniel and Jessica are unprepared for the horrifying events that follow,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394030/extras/d6f81d5596e047ddf13d07085f5fed43.poster.avif?t=1772040068\" width=1024 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394030/extras/d6f81d5596e047ddf13d07085f5fed43.webm?t=1772040068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394030/extras/d6f81d5596e047ddf13d07085f5fed43.mp4?t=1772040068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in multiple timelines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt and communicate with entities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform demonic rituals to alter your fate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover multiple endings and expand the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Paranormal Engine makes every playthrough unique</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your investigative skills to reveal the secrets within their home, communicate with demonic entities, and pierce the veil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3394030?t=1772040068","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3394030?t=1772040068","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394030/7e03cc0e96e8bef721e39e17697e57acc074baaa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772040068","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394030/7e03cc0e96e8bef721e39e17697e57acc074baaa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772040068","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains strong language, violence, murder, suicide, and references to the occult."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394030/extras/c1a2d017ab2463090370ed2600eb6824.poster.avif?t=1772040068\" width=1024 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a